DO Set mode to "prepare"/"publish"/"refine"/"explain"; bare pr → "prepare", unclear intent → NULL.

IF mode == NULL:
    ASK "Which PR action do you want: prepare, publish, refine, or explain?" AS clarified_request

    DO Resolve mode from clarified_request/original request; never infer publication intent.

CHECK mode is one of "prepare"/"publish"/"refine"/"explain".

IF mode == "publish":
    CHECK The developer explicitly requested publishing this PR.

DO Resolve absolute project, ticket_path, and pr_path; require ticket.md/pr.md (not estimate.md),
    without reset/full reads. Read ticket heading as ticket_id; reject supplied-ID mismatch. Batch
    independent reads/checks, retain exits, and reuse unchanged evidence/instructions.

DO Resolve project AGENTS.md rules/checks and explicit user naming overrides; old history never
    overrides.

IF mode == "prepare":
    USE pr/prepare.flow

IF mode == "refine":
    USE pr/refine.flow

IF mode == "explain":
    USE pr/explain.flow

IF mode == "publish":
    USE pr/publish.flow
